nded + r.demand_fee_refunded + r.order_fees_refunded > 0\n) \"Custom SQL Query\"\nGROUP BY 1", "error_message": null, "client_application": "Tableau", "start_time": "2026-08-23T06:00:14.773Z", "end_time": "2026-08-23T06:00:18.511Z", "total_duration_ms": 4511, "read_rows": 21187, "produced_rows": 7}
